    "bundle": "=== QWEN 2.1 IMAGE EDIT PROMPT BUNDLE ===

--- POSITIVE PROMPT (SINGLE_LINE) ---
In <image1>: Add the subject/object from <image2> into <image1> at the specified destination. Do not transfer identity, body shape, body proportions, body position, pose, background or hair from <image2>. Transfer facial identity from <image3>. Transfer clothing, shoes and accessories from <image2>. Reference <image2> (wardrobe) features Navy wool coat, white shirt, loafers and has high priority. Reference <image3> (face identity) features Frontal face, neutral light and has high priority. Do not transfer clothing, body shape, body proportions, body position, pose or background from <image3>. Preserve pose, body position and limb placement, body shape, body proportions, hands and hand placement, camera angle and framing, composition, background, lighting and facial expression from <image1>. Integrate transferred appearance attributes with coherent skin tone and facial lighting, natural garment fit and material behavior, perspective and lighting consistency. Integrate moved or inserted content at the destination with correct scale, depth, perspective and occlusion order. Match the scene's light direction, color temperature, contrast, depth of field and noise/grain. Ground placed objects with correct contact points and contact shadows; add reflections only where the destination material requires them. Fabric must drape and fold according to the preserved pose and body position without importing the reference person's body shape. Keep all untargeted areas of <image1> unchanged.

--- NEGATIVE PROMPT ---
deformed, bad anatomy, distorted, blurry, low quality, artifacts, extra limbs, missing fingers, bad hands, watermark, distorted face, double face, plastic skin, mismatched skin tone, unnatural eyes, disfigured facial features, garment clipping, distorted clothing, floating fabric, altered body shape, mismatched fabric

