• CFG Scale: 4.0
• Sampler: DPM++ 2M or Euler
• Base Canvas Input: <image1> (base_portrait.jpg)
• Reference Inputs: <image2> (Wardrobe), <image3> (Face Identity)
• Aspect Ratio / Resolution: Match <image1>
